gs to Send Your Artist Before You Commission Cover Art\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[var(--ink)]/20 font-mono text-xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[var(--muted)] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Written by:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"py-16 bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap max-w-3xl space-y-8 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--paper-2)]/90\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative aspect-[16/9] w-full border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30 overflow-hidden mb-10 shadow-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L10\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/cover-art/cover-04.jpg\",\"alt\":\"10 Things to Send Your Artist Before You Commission Cover Art\",\"fill\":true,\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 800px\",\"className\":\"object-cover\",\"priority\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Most commission delays don't come from the artist — they come from a brief that has to be filled in piece by piece over several messages. The fix is simple: send everything upfront. Here's the actual checklist.\"]}],[\"$\",\"hr\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"1. What You're Commissioning\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"State the format plainly: album cover, single/EP cover, manga volume cover, book cover, or standalone illustration. This alone determines format, dimensions, and typical turnaround.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"2. Reference Images\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Two to three pieces (any artist, any source) that capture the mood, color palette, or composition you want — not necessarily the subject matter, just the \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"italic text-[var(--yellow)]\",\"children\":\"feel\"}],\". This is the single highest-leverage thing you can include.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"3. Exact Title and Name Text\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"If text needs to appear on the piece — an artist name, album title, or series title — send the exact spelling and capitalization. Don't leave this for later; typography is often planned into the composition from the start.\"]}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\",\"$L20\",\"$L21\",\"$L22\",\"$L23\",\"$L24\",\"$L25\"]}],\"$L26\"]}]}],\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n29:I[87879,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n11:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"4. Any Fixed Visual Elements\"}]\n12:[\"$\",\"p\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Specific characters, objects, symbols, or colors that must appear. If a character already exists (from prior art, a comic series, or a game), send existing reference art of that character.\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"5. Format and Dimensions\"}]\n14:[\"$\",\"p\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Square for streaming platforms (3000x3000px is standard), a specific print size, or both. If you're not sure, say what the final piece will be used for and let the artist confirm the right spec.\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"6. Intended Use\"}]\n16:[\"$\",\"p\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Personal project, commercial release, merch, crowdfunding campaign — usage affects both pricing and the licensing terms you'll need.\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"7. Timeline\"}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Your actual deadline, not a padded one. If there's flexibility, say so — it can affect scheduling and sometimes price.\"]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"8. Budget Range\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A rough range (even \\\"under $X\\\" or \\\"flexible for the right fit\\\") saves both sides time compared to quoting blind and negotiating from scratch.\"]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"9. Mood/Tone in Your Own Words\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Beyond references, a sentence or two on tone — dark and moody, bright and energetic, minimal and clean — helps the artist read your intent correctly, especially where references pull in slightly different directions.\"]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"10. Anything That's a Hard No\"}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"If there's a style, color, or element you specifically don't want, say so upfront. This is often more useful than a long list of what you do want.\"]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n20:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"46\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Why This Matters More Than Picking \\\"The Right\\\" Artist\"}]\n21:[\"$\",\"p\",\"48\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A strong brief gets a good result out of most competent artists. A vague brief creates friction even with a great one — extra rounds of clarifying questions, sketches built on guesses, and revisions that are really just filling in gaps that should've been in the first message.\"]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"p\",\"50\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Structured commission processes — like the one used for \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"album, manga, and illustration work here\"}],\" — are typically built around exactly this kind of upfront brief, which is why having it ready before you reach out speeds up everything downstream: the quote, the sketch stage, and the final timeline.\"]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"52\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n24:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"54\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Final Thoughts\"}]\n25:[\"$\",\"p\",\"56\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"None of this is complicated — it's just easy to skip when you're excited to get started. Ten minutes spent gathering references and answering these questions before your first message usually saves days of back-and-forth later.\"]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 p-8 bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--ink)] shadow-[10px_10px_0_var(--red)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\",\"children\":\"Ready to Commission?\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase mb-3\",\"children\":\"Get Your Custom Artwork Stamped\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-sans text-[var(--muted)] mb-6\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio handles custom cover art, manga/comic illustrations, and logo design from brief submission to final delivery. Fill out your job ticket below for a 48-hour quote.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#order\",\"className\":\"stamp-btn inline-block !py-3 !px-6\",\"children\":\"FILL OUT JOB TICKET\"}]]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{}]\n28:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--ink)] border-t-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] py-10 color-[var(--paper-2)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-[10px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-brand font-anton text-[28px] tracking-[0.04em] text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"JHAY SANYAY\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-sub font-mono text-[12px] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Visual Artist & Illustrator · Nigeria\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-