n. This alone determines format, dimensions, and typical turnaround.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"2. Reference Images\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Two to three pieces (any artist, any source) that capture the mood, color palette, or composition you want — not necessarily the subject matter, just the \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"italic text-[var(--yellow)]\",\"children\":\"feel\"}],\". This is the single highest-leverage thing you can include.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"3. Exact Title and Name Text\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"If text needs to appear on the piece — an artist name, album title, or series title — send the exact spelling and capitalization. Don't leave this for later; typography is often planned into the composition from the start.\"]}],\"$L5\",\"$L6\",\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\",\"$La\",\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\",\"$Le\",\"$Lf\",\"$L10\",\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\"]}],\"$L1a\"]}]}],\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\"]}],[\"$L1d\"],\"$L1e\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@1f\",\"staleTime\":\"$20\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$L21\",\"isPartial\":\"$@22\",\"staleTime\":\"$20\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$L23\",\"isPartial\":\"$@24\",\"staleTime\":\"$20\",\"varyParams\":\"$25\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L26\",\"isPartial\":\"$@27\",\"staleTime\":\"$20\",\"varyParams\":\"$25\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L28\",\"isPartial\":\"$@29\",\"staleTime\":\"$20\",\"varyParams\":null}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@2a\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@2b\"}\n2c:I[87879,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n2d:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n2e:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n30:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n31:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n32:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n33:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"default\"]\n34:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"default\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2b2j6nos8u62l.css\",\"style\"]\n5:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"4. Any Fixed Visual Elements\"}]\n6:[\"$\",\"p\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Specific characters, objects, symbols, or colors that must appear. If a character already exists (from prior art, a comic series, or a game), send existing reference art of that character.\"]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"5. Format and Dimensions\"}]\n8:[\"$\",\"p\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Square for streaming platforms (3000x3000px is standard), a specific print size, or both. If you're not sure, say what the final piece will be used for and let the artist confirm the right spec.\"]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"6. Intended Use\"}]\na:[\"$\",\"p\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Personal project, commercial release, merch, crowdfunding campaign — usage affects both pricing and the licensing terms you'll need.\"]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"7. Timeline\"}]\nc:[\"$\",\"p\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Your actual deadline, not a padded one. If there's flexibility, say so — it can affect scheduling and sometimes price.\"]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"8. Budget Range\"}]\ne:[\"$\",\"p\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A rough range (even \\\"under $X\\\" or \\\"flexible for the right fit\\\") saves both sides time compared to quoting blind and negotiating from scratch.\"]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"9. Mood/Tone in Your Own Words\"}]\n10:[\"$\",\"p\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Beyond references, a sentence or two on tone — dark and moody, bright and energetic, minimal and clean — helps the artist read your intent correctly, especially where references pull in slightly different directions.\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"10. Anything That's a Hard No\"}]\n12:[\"$\",\"p\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"If there's a style, color, or element you specifically don't want, say so upfront. This is often more useful than a long list of what you do want.\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n14:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"46\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Why This Matters More Than Picking \\\"The Right\\\" Artist\"}]\n15:[\"$\",\"p\",\"48\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A strong brief gets a good result out of most competent artists. A vague brief creates friction even with a great one — extra rounds of clarifying questions, sketches built on guesses, and revisions that are really just filling in gaps that should've been in the first message.\"]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"p\",\"50\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Structured commission processes — like the one used for \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"album, manga, and illustration work here\"}],\" — are typically built around exactly this kind of upfront brief, which is why having it ready before you reach out speeds up everything downstream: the quote, the sketch stage, and the final timeline.\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"52\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n18:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"54\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Final Thoughts\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"p\",\"56\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"None of this is complicated — it's just easy to skip when you're excited to get started. Ten minutes spent gathering references and answering these questions before your first message usually saves days of back-and-forth later.\"]}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 p-8 bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--ink)] shadow-[10px_10px_0_var(--red)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\",\"children\":\"Ready to Commission?\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase mb-3\",\"children\":\"Get Your Custom Artwork Stamped\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-sans text-[var(--muted)] mb-6\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio handles custom cover art, manga/comic illustrations, and logo design from brief submission to final delivery. Fill out your job ticket below for a 48-hour quote.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#order\",\"className\":\"stamp-btn inline-block !py-3 !px-6\",\"children\":\"FILL OUT JOB TICKET\"}]]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"$L2c\",null,{}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--ink)] border-t-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] py-10 color-[var(--paper-2)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-[10px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-brand font-anton text-[28px] tracking-[0.04em] text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"JHAY SANYAY\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-sub font-mono text-[12px] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Visual Artist & Illustrator · Nigeria\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-links flex gap-[20px] font-mono text-[12px] mt-[10px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/portfolio\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Portfolio\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Guides & Blog\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://linktr.ee/jhaysanyay\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Linktree ↗\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Job Ticket\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[12px] text-[var(--yellow)] mt-[20px] tracking-wider uppercase\",\"children\":[\"designed by \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.instagram.com/buil